# tof_silent_api_takeoff.scn — the 2026-11 accident chain: API takeoff (POS_HOLD), ToF goes silent
#                              2026-11 の事故の連鎖: API 離陸（POS_HOLD）の最中に ToF が出力停止
#
# Same chain as the accident: the Tello-style `takeoff` verb (ground mode change to POS_HOLD ->
# ARM -> auto-takeoff climb) is running when the downward ToF delivers its last sample and then
# nothing. Spec under test:
#  1. The state machine aborts the climb (TAKEOFF -> LANDING); the blind descent ends by touchdown and the motors stop.
#  2. The API does not wait out its 12 s takeoff timeout: it answers "error takeoff aborted".
#  3. A second `takeoff` while the ToF is still silent is refused up front:
#     "error tof silent - check the sensor" (nothing is armed).
#
# 事故と同じ連鎖: Tello 風 `takeoff` verb（地上の POS_HOLD モード変更 → ARM → 自動離陸の上昇）が
# 実行されている最中に、下向き ToF が最後のサンプルを出し、以後は何も来ない。検証する仕様:
#  1. 状態機械が上昇を中止（TAKEOFF → LANDING）し、ToF なしの降下が接地で終わってモータが止まる。
#  2. API は 12 s の離陸タイムアウトを待たず "error takeoff aborted" を返す。
#  3. ToF が出力停止したままの 二つ目の `takeoff` は最初に拒否される:
#     "error tof silent - check the sensor"（何も ARM されない）。
#
# Run: sf sils scenario simulator/sils/scenarios/tof_silent_api_takeoff.scn --target vehicle --duration 16000000
#
#  <t>  ch        <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz>
   0    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     6000      50      # A: boot at rest — calibration completes
   +    api        "command"                                          # B: enter SDK mode (t=6)
   +    api        "takeoff"                                          # C: takeoff -> POS_HOLD -> ARM -> auto-takeoff climb
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     800       50      # D: the climb runs (to 6.8 s)
   +    tof_silent 1                                                  # E: 6.8 s — ToF output stops
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     4000      50      # F: aborted climb -> LANDING -> motors stop
   +    api        "takeoff"                                          # G: second takeoff while silent -> refused up front
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     2000      50      # H: nothing happens
